              "value": "Filth Fever"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "**Filth Fever**\nDC: 19\nSaving Throw: Fortitude\n- Stage 1: carrier with no ill effect (1d4 hours)\n- Stage 2: sickened 1 (1 day)\n- Stage 3: sickened 1 and slowed 1 as long as it remains sickened (1 day)\n- Stage 4: unconscious (1 day)"
            },
